	(text "This breakout allows direct access to the wire-bonded ASIC through \nthe I/O, MUX and power pins.\n\nWhen used in conjunction with the                  , the system may \nbe configured to automatically setup and clock specific designs on \npower-up, may do automatic detection of externally driven project\nMUX or clock/reset, and provides a Serial TUI interface through \nUSB, for use by commander or directly through serial port.\n\nSee: "
